Package: sciSpatialR
Title: Spatial Data Harmonization and Covariate Extraction for Alberta Biodiversity Projects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Brendan", "Casey", email = "brendan.casey@ualberta.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Alberta Biodiversity Monitoring Institute",
           role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: Provides tools for harmonizing spatial layers (masking,
    resampling, aggregating) and extracting covariates at point
    locations for Alberta-focused biodiversity and species distribution
    modelling workflows.  Functions cover input validation, CRS
    harmonization, harmonization to a reference grid, point-in-cell and
    buffer-based extraction, summary statistics and quick-look plots for
    inspecting raster layers, and a catalogue layer for discovering and
    retrieving canonical spatial layers.
URL: https://ABbiodiversity.github.io/sciSpatialR/,
    https://github.com/ABbiodiversity/sciSpatialR
